  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너에게서 미르의 냄새가 나...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108C5D0AC8CC11C0020BBF8B974C7580020B0C4C0C8AC000020B098002E002E002E00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "갑자기 미안한데\n혹시 너, 야돈을 데리고 있니?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC11C790AE300020BBF8C548D55CB370000AD639C2DC0020B108002C0020C57CB3C8C7440020B370B9ACACE00020C788B2C8003F00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내가 사는 가라르지방의 야돈은\n이렇게 노란 머리와 꼬리를 가졌어.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B4AC000020C0ACB2940020AC00B77CB974C9C0BC29C7580020C57CB3C8C740000AC774B807AC8C0020B178B7800020BA38B9ACC6400020AF2CB9ACB97C0020AC00C84CC5B4002E00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그런데 다른 곳은 아니라는 것 같더라고.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F0B3700020B2E4B9780020ACF3C7400020C544B2C8B77CB2940020AC830020AC19B354B77CACE0002E00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "마침 요즘 미르에서는\n야생 야돈을 볼 수 있잖아?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9C8CE680020C694C9980020BBF8B974C5D0C11CB294000AC57CC0DD0020C57CB3C8C7440020BCFC0020C2180020C788C796C544003F00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "모처럼 여행 왔으니까\n이곳의 야돈을 동료로 만들고 싶어.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BAA8CC98B7FC0020C5ECD5890020C654C73CB2C8AE4C000AC774ACF3C7580020C57CB3C8C7440020B3D9B8CCB85C0020B9CCB4E4ACE00020C2F6C5B4002E00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러니 야돈을 데리고 있다면 주지 않을래?\n대신 가라르의 야돈을 줄게.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECB2C80020C57CB3C8C7440020B370B9ACACE00020C788B2E4BA740020C8FCC9C00020C54AC744B798003F000AB300C2E00020AC00B77CB974C7580020C57CB3C8C7440020C904AC8C002E00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르시티에서 잡을 수 있는\n야돈을 데리고 있다면 내게 주라.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974C2DCD2F0C5D0C11C0020C7A1C7440020C2180020C788B294000AC57CB3C8C7440020B370B9ACACE00020C788B2E4BA740020B0B4AC8C0020C8FCB77C002E00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이곳의 야돈과 가라르의 야돈을\n교환해 줄 거야?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774ACF3C7580020C57CB3C8ACFC0020AC00B77CB974C7580020C57CB3C8C744000AAD50D658D5740020C9040020AC70C57C003F00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋아요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC544C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사양할게요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACC591D560AC8CC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋아! 교환하자.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC54400210020AD50D658D558C790002E00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가라르의 야돈은\n여기에서는 제법 희귀한 포켓몬일걸?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC00B77CB974C7580020C57CB3C8C740000AC5ECAE30C5D0C11CB2940020C81CBC950020D76CADC0D55C0020D3ECCF13BAACC77CAC78003F00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내가 원하는 건\n가라르지방에는 없는 야돈이야.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B4AC000020C6D0D558B2940020AC74000AAC00B77CB974C9C0BC29C5D0B2940020C5C6B2940020C57CB3C8C774C57C002E00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "오오! 냄새가 다르네.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C624C62400210020B0C4C0C8AC000020B2E4B974B124002E00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어라? 뭔가 너무 큰 것 같은데!?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B77C003F0020BB54AC000020B108BB340020D0700020AC830020AC19C740B3700021003F00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "겉모습이 다르단 건 알고 있었지만\n이 정도 사이즈인 줄은 몰랐어!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC89BAA8C2B5C7740020B2E4B974B2E80020AC740020C54CACE00020C788C5C8C9C0B9CC000AC7740020C815B3C40020C0ACC774C988C7780020C904C7400020BAB0B790C5B4002100100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "야앙?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C57CC559003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "하지만 멍하니 있는 이 표정...\n역시 야돈은 야돈이구나!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D558C9C0B9CC0020BA4DD558B2C80020C788B2940020C7740020D45CC815002E002E002E000AC5EDC2DC0020C57CB3C8C7400020C57CB3C8C774AD6CB098002100100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "귀중한 야돈을 받아서\n정말 기뻐!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADC0C911D55C0020C57CB3C8C7440020BC1BC544C11C000AC815B9D00020AE30BED0002100100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "들은 얘기로는 야도란으로 진화하면\n모습이 더 많이 달라진대.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B4E4C7400020C598AE30B85CB2940020C57CB3C4B780C73CB85C0020C9C4D654D558BA74000ABAA8C2B5C7740020B3540020B9CEC7740020B2ECB77CC9C4B300002E00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가라르의 야도란은 독타입이고...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC00B77CB974C7580020C57CB3C4B780C7400020B3C5D0C0C785C774ACE0002E002E002E00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어이쿠! 그 이상의 정보는\n네 눈으로 직접 확인해 봐.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4C774CFE000210020ADF80020C774C0C1C7580020C815BCF4B294000AB1240020B208C73CB85C0020C9C1C8110020D655C778D5740020BD10002E00100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가라르의 모습인 야돈을\n소중히 대해 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC00B77CB974C7580020BAA8C2B5C7780020C57CB3C8C744000AC18CC911D7880020B300D5740020C918002100100002011401360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "귀중한 야돈을 줘서 고마워!\n가라르의 모습인 야돈을 소중히 대해 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
